      "section_id": "kohler-volume-2:p0413-p0416:s00:x00",
      "section_type": "taxonomy",
      "original_text": "                                 Croton Eluteria Bennet.\n                                       Syn. Clutia Eluteria L.\n\n      Kaskarille, Croton, Schakarille — Cascarille officinale —                 Bahama-Cascarilla.\n         Familie: Euphorbiaceae; (Unterfam.: Crotoneae); Gattung:              Croton (L), J. Müller Arg.",
      "normalized_text": null,
      "zh_tw_rendering": "學名 Croton Eluteria Bennet，同義名 Clutia Eluteria L.，屬大戟科。",
      "evidence_indexes": [
        0
      ],
